  "extractedText": "⚡️ You're in the right article if you're looking to…\n\ncompare our plans, based on their features.\nsee an overview of all Buffer features.\n\nHave you seen our pricing page? If you have, you might have noticed that we have four plans: Free, Essentials, Team, and Agency plans. \nThe Free plan is ideal for individual users who are looking to schedule content on up to three social channels.\nThe Essentials plan is geared towards individuals who want to schedule content for their brand’s social channels. The Essentials plan offers more features and includes access to Buffer’s advanced analytics, reporting, and engagement tools.\nThe Team plan includes the same features as the Essentials plan, but includes unlimited users to help you collaborate on posts and manage your channels.\nIf you’re managing 10 or more social channels, the Agency plan provides all of the features of both the Essentials and Team plan (the Agency plan also includes unlimited team members), at a lower price point. Your 11th channel and higher are priced at $6 a month (or $60 a year) instead of $12.\nScan through our many features below, then head over to our pricing page to start a free trial and test the features out yourself!\n📝 Use our Pricing Calculator for your tailored monthly or annual cost estimate.\n\n \nFree plan\nEssentials plan\nTeam plan\nAgency plan\n\nPlan information\n \n \n \n \n\nMonthly price\n$0/month\n$6/month per channel\n$12/month per channel\n$120/month for 10 channels. Additional channels are $6 each\n\nYearly price\n$0/month\n$60/year per channel\n$120/year per channel\n$1,200/year for 10 channels. $60/year for each additional channel\n\nNumber of channel connections\n3\nUnlimited ($6 per channel)\nUnlimited ($12 per channel)\nUnlimited ($120 for 10 channels, $6 for each additional channel)\n\nScheduled posts\n10 per channel,up to 30 total if you have 3 channels connected.\n2,000\n2,000\n2,000\n\nIncluded users\n1\n1\n1\n1\n\nInvite additional users\n0